    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "cc92ba5d-5f98-4e6d-b8ae-85e59f2228de",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "新西兰遗留问题New Zealand&apos;s lingering issues",
        "Location": "LOCATION_NEWZEALAND",
        "PublicId": "120858854101",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/sheep/scene_sheep.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 6024f334-d840-4418-b3b0-12a2870150c4).Image",
        "Description": "契约已发布，你已获得行动许可。尽可能干净利落地消灭所有目标，避免一切连带伤害。\rICA组织发现在处理新西兰的暗杀行动中，仍有三个遗留的人物，他们在暗中参与并掩护了整个犯罪事件的发展，所以ICA决定再次让47前往新西兰将剩余的三人悄悄消灭。\rThe ICA organization discovered that there were still three remaining individuals involved in the assassination operation in New Zealand, who had covertly participated in and shielded the entire criminal development. Therefore, the ICA decided to once again send 47 to New Zealand to quietly eliminate the remaining three individuals.",
        "GameVersion": "8.23.0.0",
        "IsPublished": true,
        "Entitlements": [
            "LOCATION_NEWZEALAND"
        ],
